Usage of ./bench:
  -data string
    	path to data directory (default "./data")
  -debugname
    	use benchN as room name
  -dumpgamelog int
    	save gamelog into tmp direcotry (1:if postTest failed 2:always)
  -jobid string
    	job id
  -memprof
    	save mem profile into tmp direcotry
  -nolevelup
    	dont increase load level
  -nostaticfile
    	dont check static file
  -output string
    	path to write result json
  -portal string
    	portal site url (only used on workermode) (default "http://localhost:8888")
  -profile
    	save cpu profile into tmp direcotry
  -remotes string
    	remote addrs to benchmark (default "localhost:5000")
  -strictcache
    	compare cached json strictly
  -tempdir string
    	path to temp dir
  -test
    	run pretest only
  -validatelog string
    	path to gzipped gamelog to debug validation
  -workermode
    	workermode
